**Files created/modified (all in scope):**
- `crates/catalog-openzim/Cargo.toml` — added deps (domain, ports, async-trait, bytes, futures-util, quick-xml/serialize, serde, serde_json, url; dev tokio)
- `crates/catalog-openzim/src/lib.rs` — module wiring + port re-exports
- `crates/catalog-openzim/src/validate.rs` — id / language / URL-scheme / sha256 / size validators (reject → `Malformed`)
- `crates/catalog-openzim/src/store.rs` — shared snapshot, refresh diff (added/updated/removed), filter, paginate, find_entry
- `crates/catalog-openzim/src/openzim_xml.rs` — `OpenZimXmlCatalogSource` (`catalog.openzim.xml.v1`) + shared `verify_catalog_signature` + `collect_stream`
- `crates/catalog-openzim/src/enzime_json.rs` — `EnzimeJsonCatalogSource` (`catalog.enzime.json.v1`) + inline-signature verification
- `crates/catalog-openzim/tests/catalog_sources.rs` — integration tests with in-memory `TransferSource` + `ScriptedSignatureProvider`

**Behaviour:**
- Fetches catalog bytes through the injected `ports::transfer::TransferSource` (Ring-2 to Ring-1 discipline per A-02)
- Verifies the catalog signature via the injected `ports::signature::SignatureProvider` **before** parsing untrusted bytes; missing/invalid signature → `InvalidSignature` when `require_signature=true` (the default)
- OpenZIM `<library>/<book>` XML normalized to canonical `CatalogEntry`; bad sha256/URL/size/language/id → `Malformed` (never coerced)
- EnZIME JSON `enzime-catalog-v1` envelope with embedded `signature`; `signed_domain` must match the configured value
- `refresh` reports added/updated/removed vs the prior snapshot; `search` filters by text/languages/categories/max-size with offset+limit pagination; `entry` returns `NotFound`

**`cargo check -p catalog-openzim`:** Finished, zero warnings on this crate (only an unrelated unused-import warning in `crates/domain/src/annotation.rs`).

**`cargo test -p catalog-openzim`:** 28/28 passing (15 unit + 13 integration).
